    <values><field>LongDescription__c</field><value xsi:type="xsd:string">Finds: Orgs whose combined count of price rules + summary variables exceeds a complexity threshold.
Why it matters: Above ~100 rules + variables, configurator performance degrades sharply. Quotes take 10+ seconds to recalc, large carts hit governor limits, and admin maintenance becomes brittle.
Suppress a finding: when the org is genuinely high-complexity by design and the performance has been engineered around.
Disable the detector: only if performance benchmarks contradict the threshold. Most should leave this on.</value></values>
